    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting with a small settlement, you'll gather resources, construct buildings, and gradually expand your influence. As your faction grows, you'll face challenges both internal and external.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your economy: Gather resources and construct buildings to grow your faction.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command powerful forces: Build up your armies and recruit unique heroes and mercenaries to lead them.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dungeons: Raid procedurally generated dungeons for armor and powerful weapons.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in diplomacy: Form alliances, conduct trade, or wage war against other factions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance your faction: Research new technologies and unlock new abilities to stay ahead of other factions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting with a small settlement, you'll gather resources, construct buildings, and gradually expand your influence. As your faction grows, you'll face challenges both internal and external.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your economy: Gather resources and construct buildings to grow your faction.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command powerful forces: Build up your armies and recruit unique heroes and mercenaries to lead them.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dungeons: Raid procedurally generated dungeons for armor and powerful weapons.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in diplomacy: Form alliances, conduct trade, or wage war against other factions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance your faction: Research new technologies and unlock new abilities to stay ahead of other factions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Arinoa: Conquest is a real time grand strategy game with a focus on hero units, and combines elements of strategy, resource management, and light RPG mechanics. Gather resources, build your army, and conquer your enemies within the harsh world of Arinoa.",
